 ker in Transylvania oversees an eviction that goes wrong\, she spirals int
 o an existential crisis that forces her to confront her place in a frenzie
 d world.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/romanian-film-festival
 -seattle-13th-edition/kontinental-25\n\nEstimated start: 14:05
