BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:R.M.N. (2022)
DTSTART:20261115T030500Z
DTEND:20261115T053000Z
DTSTAMP:20261115T030500Z
UID:xXdK9xZgvT
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 128 mins (2h08m)\n\nRomanian Film Festival Seattle 
 Presented by the American Romanian Cultural Society. When a multi-ethnic T
 ransylvanian village hires Sri Lankan workers at the local bakery\, latent
  xenophobia and historic tribal resentments explode\, fracturing the commu
 nity's veneer of peace.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/romania
 n-film-festival-seattle-13th-edition/rmn\n\nEstimated start: 19:20
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
