BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Christmas Pop-Up
DTSTART:20261220T033000Z
DTEND:20261220T052000Z
DTSTAMP:20261220T033000Z
UID:NJGxrLb0fS
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 93 mins (1h33m)\n\nPresented by Blue Egg Films and P
 aper Palace Productions. Desperate for a fresh start\, an unlucky-in-love
  set decorator takes a job designing a Christmas Eve pop-up event for a ja
 ded celebrity chef\, hoping to escape her current hell: living with her ex
  and his new girlfriend… before he proposes on New Year’s Eve.\n\nhttp
 s://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/christmas-pop-up\n\nEstimated start: 1
 9:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
